  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "After Winged Blade slices Duke Long’s right dragon horn, the black-gold giant of Seven Extreme Desolation hooks a finger at him and activates this immortal killer move. A green-gold rope appears on Duke Long’s body, wraps around his waist thrice, and pulls him toward the giant. He shouts, shakes his muscular body, breaks free, and retreats to avoid a second Winged Blade. The formation has a powerful version of this capturing move, but spiraling dragon fang would cut the rope if the giant tried to bind him again. The seven Huang Jin elites use tribal trump cards; this one is Ye Lui tribe’s.",
